    "around the needle tip."
  ],
  "w7": [
    "So that is",
    "why the rush",
    "stops at a ring:",
    "in Roché's model,",
    "past it the soap",
    "has left the surface.",
    "And the ring is useful.",
    "The authors",
    "suggest estimating the micelle threshold",
